	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Body = `Cesium 3D Globe Scene Graph

A [models.MapView] configures the 3D globe camera (WGS84 center, zoom, pitch, bearing, and imagery/tile StyleURL)
and stacks ordered [models.Layer] groups. Each visible [models.Layer] renders 2D/3D extruded [models.Polygon] volumes,
[models.Polyline] trajectories, and custom SVG [models.Marker] pins anchored at [models.Coordinate] vertices.
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.BodyHTML = `<p>Cesium 3D Globe Scene Graph
<p>A <a href="/models#MapView">models.MapView</a> configures the 3D globe camera (WGS84 center, zoom, pitch, bearing, and imagery/tile StyleURL)
and stacks ordered <a href="/models#Layer">models.Layer</a> groups. Each visible <a href="/models#Layer">models.Layer</a> renders 2D/3D extruded <a href="/models#Polygon">models.Polygon</a> volumes,
<a href="/models#Polyline">models.Polyline</a> trajectories, and custom SVG <a href="/models#Marker">models.Marker</a> pins anchored at <a href="/models#Coordinate">models.Coordinate</a> vertices.
`
